+// ── Darwish — Customer Listening / Group Resolution (Phase 1) ─────────────
+//
+// Darwish is deliberately isolated from the canonical WhatsApp tables.
+// Phase 1 never rewrites whatsapp_messages / whatsapp_chats. It stores only
